%S A401810 1,2,23,400,7165,128558,2306867,41395036
%N A401810 Indices of records of A401756.
%C A401810 Conjecture: a(k) = (Fibonacci(6*k-7)+3)/4 for k >= 1, with Fibonacci(-1) = 1; this holds for k <= 8. Equivalently, a(k) = (A134497(k-2)+3)/4 for k >= 2.
%C A401810 Conjecture: the orbit of (2*a(k)-1, 1) under the outer billiards map of A401756 contains exactly A107839(k-1) points (2j-1, 1) with j >= 1; this holds for k <= 8.
%C A401810 A401809 gives the corresponding record values.
%e A401810 a(3) = 23: A401756(23) = 2757494 is the first term of A401756 larger than A401756(2) = 3742.
%Y A401810 Cf. A000045, A107839, A134497, A401756, A401809.
